ound to be expressed in some ovarian cancers. The encoded protein is a small secretory protein, which may be involved in sperm maturation. [provided by RefSeq, Jul 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q14508","text":"Plays a critical role in lung development (By similarity). Required for terminal differentiation of bronchiole club cells (By similarity). Required for development of airway barrier mechanisms, such as lamellar body formation in type II alveolar epithelial cells and cilia formation on ciliated epithelial cells following initiation of respiration at birth (By similarity). Required for type I alveolar epithelial cell and vascular endothelial development in the lungs, thereby mediating blood-air barrier exchange (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}